activity Initiate Fund Transfer
activity Validate Transfer Requisition
activity Authorize Transfer
activity Execute Transfer
activity Generate Transfer Document
activity Assess Transfer Document
activity Notify Stakeholders
activity Reconcile Accounts
activity Close Transfer Process
bind Initiate Fund Transfer: Transfer Identifier, Transfer Amount, Account Category
bind Validate Transfer Requisition: Transfer Identifier, Transfer State, Validator Identifier
bind Authorize Transfer: Transfer Identifier, Approver Identifier
bind Execute Transfer: Transfer Identifier
bind Generate Transfer Document: Transfer Identifier
bind Assess Transfer Document: Transfer Identifier, Discrepancy Degree, Reviewer Identifier
bind Notify Stakeholders: Transfer Identifier, Notification Method
bind Reconcile Accounts: Transfer Identifier
bind Close Transfer Process: Transfer Identifier
Transfer Identifier: integer between 1 and 999999
Transfer Amount: float between 0.01 and 1000000.0
Transfer State: Pending, Validated, Approved, Completed, Rejected
Account Category: Checking, Savings, Business
Validator Identifier: integer between 1 and 9999
Approver Identifier: integer between 1 and 9999
Notification Method: Email, SMS, Push Notification
Discrepancy Degree: Low, Medium, High
Reviewer Identifier: integer between 1 and 9999
Init[Initiate Fund Transfer] | |
Chain Succession[Initiate Fund Transfer, Validate Transfer Requisition] | | |
Chain Succession[Validate Transfer Requisition, Authorize Transfer] | | |
Chain Succession[Authorize Transfer, Execute Transfer] | | |0,2,h
Chain Succession[Execute Transfer, Generate Transfer Document] | | |
Chain Succession[Generate Transfer Document, Assess Transfer Document] | | |
Chain Succession[Assess Transfer Document, Notify Stakeholders] | | |0,1,h
Chain Succession[Notify Stakeholders, Reconcile Accounts] | | |
Chain Succession[Reconcile Accounts, Close Transfer Process] | | |
End[Close Transfer Process] | |